!/chinese-extraction/tatoeba/
/chinese-extraction/tatoeba/*
!/chinese-extraction/tatoeba/*.md

# Non-publishable data: Anki shared deck (personal study only) and its derived sentences; see chinese-dataset/sources.json
chinese-dataset/sentences/anki-tatoeba/
chinese-dataset/sentences/tatoeba-unlicensed/

# Full local dataset archive (266 MB, exceeds GitHub's 100 MB file limit and includes non-publishable sets)
